                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "fun and hard game, felt intense a lot of the time including some \"how is it possible to make this jump\" kind of moments until you get it. probably more people will be able to make it all the way up because of the thing that lets you save anywhere (compared to \"getting over it with bennett foddy\" or \"jump king\" etc i guess but i have only completed one of those), but i cant imagine completing this one myself without saves like those games. but this one can be completed in one evening if you do save a lot (unless youre bad at save management like i was at first lol). i think theres some good variety of challenges and i like the song at the top too. since this game is inexpensive it was defentely worth it for the challenge!",
